Read [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) first. It is the single entry point for all AI coding
agents in this repo: stack, commands, the 12 hard rules, the two authorization tracks,
and pointers into `docs/`.

Before starting a task, read [docs/TASKS.md](mdc:docs/TASKS.md) — it records what is done
and what is next. Before changing an architectural choice, read
[docs/DECISIONS.md](mdc:docs/DECISIONS.md) and supersede the relevant ADR explicitly
rather than contradicting it silently.
